# Cloudflare redirect rules.
#
# This site replaces the live proudtosmile.com, so every URL pattern the old
# Tebra/PatientPop site used must land on its equivalent here rather than 404.
# Old URL patterns are from reference/content-proudtosmile.md.
#
# Format: /from  /to  status
#
# CAUTION: a splat rule shadows exact rules sharing its prefix, whatever the
# file order — verified on the staging Worker, where `/provider/*` was
# swallowing the two exact provider rules listed above it and sending both
# providers to the /doctors/ index. So never pair `/prefix/*` with exact
# `/prefix/<slug>` rules: enumerate the slugs, or accept the splat for all of
# them. `/post/*` below is safe because no exact /post/ rule competes with it.

# --- Blog: the old site served posts at /post/<slug> -----------------------
/post/*                     /blog/:splat/                        301
/blog-archive               /blog/                               301

# --- Providers: /provider/<slug> and the /providers index ------------------
# The old site published exactly these two providers, so enumerating them
# costs no coverage and keeps each landing on its own page.
/provider/patricia-swaintek-lamb-dmd  /doctors/patricia-swaintek-lamb-dmd/  301
/provider/karima-west-rdh             /doctors/karima-west-rdh/             301
/providers                            /doctors/                             301

# --- Contact: the old site had /contact-us; this build folds contact detail
#     into the location page (single practice, per client decision) ----------
/contact-us                 /locations/bernardsville/            301

# --- Legacy /content/<topic> service URLs -----------------------------------
# Pre-Tebra URLs still cited by the practice's own older blog posts, so real
# inbound links to them exist. Same mapping the migrated post bodies use.
/content/dental-gallery                    /smile-gallery/                                  301
/content/about-our-dental-office           /about/                                          301
/content/cosmetic-dentistry                /service/cosmetic-and-restorative-dentistry/     301
/content/dental-bonding-tooth-bonding      /service/cosmetic-and-restorative-dentistry/     301
/content/dental-crowns                     /service/crowns/                                 301
/content/dental-implants                   /service/dental-implants/                        301
/content/dentures-partials                 /service/dentures/                               301
/content/gum-disease-and-advanced-hygiene  /service/periodontal-therapy/                    301
/content/porcelain-veneers                 /service/veneers/                                301
/content/tooth-whitening                   /service/teeth-whitening/                        301
# No counterpart on this build — send these to the nearest hub rather than 404.
/content/tmj-or-tmd                        /services/                                       301
/content/velscope-oral-cancer-screening    /service/cleaning/                               301
/content/proud-to-smile-celebration-party  /blog/come-and-celebrate-our-exciting-news/      301

# --- Legal: the old site used non-standard slugs ----------------------------
/your-privacy               /privacy-policy/                     301
/our-terms                  /terms-conditions/                   301

# --- Design-reference leftovers ---------------------------------------------
# /dental-veneers was the reference site's flat service URL. The real practice
# publishes veneers at /service/veneers, so this is a redirect, not a page.
/dental-veneers             /service/veneers/                    301
